__pycache__/
*.pyc
.session.lock
.session.lock.d/
runs/.prefix-*
# The API key, when kept in a file for local runs. Never committed.
.env
# Built by the phase0 workflow and restored from cache. Never committed:
# a stale binary in the tree is how a false lemma survives the referee.
GROUND_TRUTH/solver
GROUND_TRUTH/solver.exe
GROUND_TRUTH/*.obj
GROUND_TRUTH/cache/
# Third-party papers, refetched by GROUND_TRUTH/fetch_sources.py.
# This repo is public; redistributing them is not ours to do. The
# tests need none of it -- see GROUND_TRUTH/tests/data/SOURCES.md.
GROUND_TRUTH/data/
islands/*/scratch/
# Sheiner's Lean archive is unpublished and was shared privately. It lives
# in the private repo dannguyen111/chomp-lean, cloned here. Only the
# README pointing to it is committed.
GROUND_TRUTH/lean/*
!GROUND_TRUTH/lean/README.md
